            "review_title": "Review at REDCAP Pizza",
            "review_text": "Thu Hang Ngo\nHanoi, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nNice experience\nAug 2018 • Friends\nCame there for lunch and I was quite impressed by its nice view out of the window. Decoration was bright and the food was delicious (quite expensive on comparison with other pizza house in Hanoi, however). And I think it would be nice if there was a bell on each table so that the guests can make their orders more comfortably. Altogether it's worth spending time here with your friends, family or lover.\nRead more\nWritten August 23, 2018",
